        "path": "orchestrator/planner_context.py",
        "line": 203,
        "issue": "The notice says the handover was started automatically and also gives the manual handover command. The Planner may run it again, which duplicates the handover. Only the existing handover.py throttle would stop that. The wording is a trade-off to satisfy test_cli.",
        "severity": "low"
